{
  "epilogue": [
    "The Floating City blotted out the sky. Soldiers stood against it.",
    "Fire rained down. One after another, they fell.",
    "But I saw one soldier rise again.",
    "Amid the torrents of light, that soldier fought on.",
    "A flash. A shot pierced the heart of the Floating City.",
    "The fortress erupted in flames, tilted, and fell.",
    "The saucers reeled as if mourning their king.",
    "They burst and scattered. It was over.",
    "Humanity had won. But that lone soldier...",
    "The one who saved us vanished in the city's flames."
  ],
